             <item row="10" column="0" colspan="4"><widget class="QLabel" name="bandwidthLabel"><property name="text"><string>计算定位相位带宽…</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property></widget></item><item row="11" column="0" colspan="2"><widget class="QPushButton" name="fitGeometryRangeButton"><property name="text"><string>调整标定探测范围</string></property><property name="toolTip"><string>仅缩小局部标定探测范围并保持比例；不改变重建目标尺寸、实际距离或 SLM 有效口径。</string></property><property name="autoDefault"><bool>false</bool></property></widget></item><item row="11" column="2" colspan="2"><widget class="QLabel" name="bandwidthNote"><property name="text"><string>只调整局部探测范围；目标视野不变。完整目标边缘还需独立验证。</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property></widget></item><item row="12" column="0"><widget class="QLabel" name="geometry_spot_max_fwhmLabel"><property name="text"><string>光斑最大半高全宽 / px</string></property></widget></item><item row="12" column="1"><widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="geometry_spot_max_fwhm"><property name="toolTip"><string>0 为自动：原始帧短边的 4%，限制在 12～160 px；不是搜索 ROI 大小。</string></property><property name="decimals"><number>2</number></property><property name="minimum"><double>0</double></property><property name="maximum"><double>512</double></property><property name="value"><double>0</double></property><property name="keyboardTracking"><bool>false</bool></property></widget></item><item row="12" column="2"><widget class="QLabel" name="geometry_spot_stabilityLabel"><property name="text"><string>中心稳定性限值 / px</string></property></widget></item><item row="12" column="3"><widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="geometry_spot_stability"><property name="toolTip"><string>同时用于外围拟合稳定性与重复采集的位置变化检查；独立于映射验证容差。</string></property><property name="decimals"><number>2</number></property><property name="minimum"><double>0.05</double></property><property name="maximum"><double>10</double></property><property name="value"><double>1</double></property><property name="keyboardTracking"><bool>false</bool></property></widget></item><item row="13" column="0"><widget class="QLabel" name="geometry_repeatsLabel"><property name="text"><string>每点重复采集次数</string></property></widget></item><item row="13" column="1"><widget class="QSpinBox" name="geometry_repeats"><property name="toolTip"><string>每次仍使用采集平均帧数；1 次会跳过跨采集稳定性检查，默认 2 次。</string></property><property name="minimum"><number>1</number></property><property name="maximum"><number>5</number></property><property name="value"><number>2</number></property><property name="keyboardTracking"><bool>false</bool></property></widget></item><item row="13" column="2" colspan="2"><widget class="QLabel" name="geometrySpotNote"><property name="text"><string>允许有限中心饱和；需有完整、稳定的未饱和外围。</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property></widget></item><item row="14" column="0" colspan="2"><widget class="QPushButton" name="useGeometrySearchRoiButton"><property name="text"><string>读取第三页 ROI 为搜索区域</string></property><property name="autoDefault"><bool>false</bool></property></widget></item><item row="14" column="2" colspan="2"><widget class="QPushButton" name="clearGeometrySearchRoiButton"><property name="text"><string>清除搜索区域</string></property><property name="autoDefault"><bool>false</bool></property></widget></item><item row="15" column="0" colspan="4"><widget class="QLabel" name="geometrySearchLabel"><property name="text"><string>搜索：整个原始画面</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property><property name="toolTip"><string>读取前在第三页画框；不改变硬件 ROI 或最终目标 ROI。此固定框需包含全部定位点。逐点辅助的临时框只用于当前点，不覆盖此设置。</string></property></widget></item><item row="16" column="0"><widget class="QLabel" name="geometryAssistanceLabel"><property name="text"><string>定位辅助</string></property></widget></item><item row="16" column="1" colspan="3"><widget class="QComboBox" name="geometryAssistanceComboBox"><property name="toolTip"><string>逐点辅助：首次采集后暂停，到第三页框选当前光斑。重复采集复用该框；识别失败可重框或调整曝光重拍。框只限制搜索，不代替精确拟合。</string></property><item><property name="text"><string>全自动</string></property></item><item><property name="text"><string>逐点手动辅助</string></property></item><item><property name="text"><string>自动定位，失败时手动辅助</string></property></item></widget></item><item row="17" column="0" colspan="1"><widget class="QLabel" name="geometry_detectorLabel"><property name="text"><string>中心识别</string></property></widget></item><item row="17" column="1" colspan="1"><widget class="QComboBox" name="geometry_detector"><item><property name="text"><string>紧凑亮斑</string></property></item><item><property name="text"><string>圆环 / 径向对称中心</string></property></item></widget></item><item row="17" column="2" colspan="1"><widget class="QLabel" name="geometry_probeLabel"><property name="text"><string>探测相位</string></property></widget></item><item row="17" column="3" colspan="1"><widget class="QComboBox" name="geometry_probe"><item><property name="text"><string>聚焦 / 菲涅尔</string></property></item><item><property name="text"><string>圆形相位区（非振幅孔径）</string></property></item><item><property name="text"><string>轴锥</string></property></item></widget></item><item row="18" column="0" colspan="1"><widget class="QLabel" name="geometry_ring_radiusLabel"><property name="text"><string>圆环分析半径 / px</string></property></widget></item><item row="18" column="1" colspan="1"><widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="geometry_ring_radius"><property name="minimum"><double>12</double></property><property name="maximum"><double>1024</double></property><property name="value"><double>100</double></property><property name="decimals"><number>3</number></property><property name="keyboardTracking"><bool>false</bool></property><property name="toolTip"><string>原始相机像素；围绕粗框中心使用完整内圈，自动限制在框内。不是光斑半高全宽。</string></property></widget></item><item row="18" column="2" colspan="1"><widget class="QLabel" name="geometry_probe_radius_umLabel"><property name="text"><string>圆形相位区半径 / μm</string></property></widget></item><item row="18" column="3" colspan="1"><widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="geometry_probe_radius_um"><property name="minimum"><double>1</double></property><property name="maximum"><double>10000</double></property><property name="value"><double>300</double></property><property name="decimals"><number>3</number></property><property name="keyboardTracking"><bool>false</bool></property><property name="toolTip"><string>固定在 SLM 中心；相位差 π，边缘平滑四个硬件像素。通过相位斜坡移动衍射图形。</string></property></widget></item><item row="19" column="0" colspan="1"><widget class="QLabel" name="geometry_axicon_period_umLabel"><property name="text"><string>轴锥径向周期 / μm</string></property></widget></item><item row="19" column="1" colspan="1"><widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="geometry_axicon_period_um"><property name="minimum"><double>1</double></property><property name="maximum"><double>10000</double></property><property name="value"><double>85</double></property><property name="decimals"><number>3</number></property><property name="keyboardTracking"><bool>false</bool></property><property name="toolTip"><string>径向相位每 2π 对应的物理距离；不是焦距。</string></property></widget></item><item row="19" column="2" colspan="1"><widget class="QLabel" name="geometry_exposure_targetLabel"><property name="text"><string>曝光亮度目标 / 满量程</string></property></widget></item><item row="19" column="3" colspan="1"><widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="geometry_exposure_target"><property name="minimum"><double>0.2</double></property><property name="maximum"><double>0.85</double></property><property name="value"><double>0.65</double></property><property name="decimals"><number>3</number></property><property name="keyboardTracking"><bool>false</bool></property><property name="toolTip"><string>探测图案的平滑峰值目标；曝光值不是定位检测阈值。</string></property></widget></item><item row="20" column="0" colspan="2"><widget class="QCheckBox" name="geometry_auto_exposure"><property name="text"><string>标定前自动准备曝光并锁定</string></property><property name="checked"><bool>false</bool></property></widget></item><item row="20" column="2" colspan="2"><widget class="QCheckBox" name="geometry_movement_check"><property name="text"><string>先检查中心、左右、上下移动</string></property><property name="checked"><bool>true</bool></property></widget></item><item row="21" column="0" colspan="4"><widget class="QLabel" name="geometryRingNote"><property name="text"><string>圆环模式需粗框中心及数圈完整环纹；可用逐点辅助。圆形相位区与轴锥采用固定图案加相位斜坡，需实测移动及独立验证。</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property></widget></item></layout>
            </widget>
           </item>
           <item>
